WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.580
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.850 --> 01:43.070
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.120 --> 01:43.740
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.740 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 22]

5
02:17.000 --> 02:17.910
Your Highness!

6
02:18.000 --> 02:18.840
Li Si!

7
02:21.710 --> 02:22.520
Li Si.

8
02:24.430 --> 02:25.240
Jiuying?

9
02:28.000 --> 02:28.800
Aunt.

10
02:31.400 --> 02:32.600
What brings you here?

11
02:33.630 --> 02:35.590
She couldn't bear being idle at my place,

12
02:35.590 --> 02:36.470
so I brought her along

13
02:36.470 --> 02:37.430
to gain some experience.

14
02:37.430 --> 02:38.240
Come on.

15
02:39.000 --> 02:40.600
Let me take a good look at you.

16
02:43.000 --> 02:44.600
You've really changed a lot.

17
02:45.400 --> 02:46.190
Jiuying,

18
02:47.000 --> 02:47.840
now,

19
02:48.240 --> 02:49.329
you're more and more

20
02:49.329 --> 02:50.430
like a heroine.

21
02:51.840 --> 02:52.640
Aunt must have

22
02:54.030 --> 02:56.000
taken good care of you.

23
03:03.120 --> 03:04.430
Don't bother to look for them.

24
03:04.430 --> 03:05.660
Zhenzhu, Yan Cheng, and the others

25
03:05.660 --> 03:07.320
have set off for Gutan County.

26
03:10.560 --> 03:11.520
Gutan County?

27
03:13.080 --> 03:13.890
Has there been

28
03:13.920 --> 03:15.320
any major case recently?

29
03:17.150 --> 03:18.550
The Grand Heir Apparent.

30
03:18.560 --> 03:19.960
The Grand Heir Apparent?

31
03:21.430 --> 03:22.590
What happened to Ye?

32
03:22.710 --> 03:23.590
Don't fret.

33
03:23.840 --> 03:24.840
It's not a case.

34
03:25.310 --> 03:27.590
The Grand Heir Apparent is leaving for the Golden Dragon Pavilion

35
03:27.590 --> 03:28.920
to pray for His Majesty.

36
03:31.150 --> 03:32.240
Aunt,

37
03:33.430 --> 03:36.000
the two remaining mural figures of ancient Liluo Sect

38
03:36.000 --> 03:37.360
have yet to be found.

39
03:37.840 --> 03:39.100
At the thought of that,

40
03:39.240 --> 03:40.310
my heart is

41
03:40.590 --> 03:42.100
always unsettled.

42
03:42.190 --> 03:43.800
I know what's on your mind.

43
03:44.360 --> 03:46.030
I share your premonition.

44
03:49.240 --> 03:50.430
Just now, you mentioned

45
03:50.430 --> 03:51.690
Yan Cheng and Zhenzhu.

46
03:53.120 --> 03:54.520
Then what about Meng Rui?

47
03:55.310 --> 03:56.640
Did Meng Rui set out too?

48
03:59.560 --> 04:01.220
Since that incident of yours,

49
04:01.240 --> 04:02.710
Meng Rui has always locked himself up

50
04:02.710 --> 04:03.970
in the Winter's Haven,

51
04:04.430 --> 04:05.960
refusing to talk to anyone.

52
04:11.400 --> 04:12.190
As of now,

53
04:12.840 --> 04:13.960
Li San is dead.

54
04:14.800 --> 04:16.000
Zhou Yan from the past

55
04:16.430 --> 04:17.630
is also dead.

56
04:18.360 --> 04:19.890
The only one still alive now

57
04:20.240 --> 04:22.100
is Divine Constable Li Qingyang.

58
04:24.270 --> 04:25.070
Aunt,

59
04:26.600 --> 04:28.560
I'd like to go to Gutan County as well.

60
04:28.560 --> 04:29.560
I wish to join Yan Cheng, Zhenzhu,

61
04:29.560 --> 04:30.430
and the others

62
04:31.310 --> 04:33.430
to contribute to the Divine Constable Bureau again

63
04:33.430 --> 04:35.490
and protect the Grand Heir Apparent.

64
04:36.240 --> 04:38.640
Divine Constable Qingyang, heed my order.

65
04:40.040 --> 04:41.560
Whatever you command, Chief.

66
04:41.560 --> 04:43.560
Quickly go to Gutan County to support

67
04:43.560 --> 04:45.430
two fellow Divine Constables in secret.

68
04:45.430 --> 04:46.830
No mistakes are allowed.

69
04:46.830 --> 04:47.630
Got it.

70
04:49.600 --> 04:50.950
Take Jiuying with you.

71
04:51.000 --> 04:52.630
She's a good fighter who can serve tea

72
04:52.630 --> 04:53.960
and do all your bidding.

73
04:56.680 --> 04:57.480
Come here.

74
04:57.750 --> 04:59.390
Let me take a good look at you.

75
05:02.430 --> 05:04.030
You've grown much stronger.

76
05:05.240 --> 05:06.040
This is great.

77
05:09.680 --> 05:10.870
The holy water

78
05:11.040 --> 05:12.950
will bring my son back to health.

79
05:19.960 --> 05:24.670
[Golden Dragon Hall]

80
05:34.190 --> 05:35.560
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

81
05:35.560 --> 05:36.890
is indeed spectacular.

82
05:37.430 --> 05:38.240
Let's go.

83
05:48.830 --> 05:49.630
This must be

84
05:49.920 --> 05:51.450
the Dragon Pond holy water.

85
05:53.040 --> 05:54.920
It appears that kowtowing and praying

86
05:54.920 --> 05:55.930
are no longer enough

87
05:55.930 --> 05:57.850
to soothe the longing in people's hearts.

88
05:57.850 --> 05:58.790
Zhenzhu.

89
05:59.070 --> 06:00.000
Give me a moment.

90
06:00.950 --> 06:01.850
Sir,

91
06:02.040 --> 06:03.120
I'd like some holy water.

92
06:03.120 --> 06:03.920
Sure.

93
06:14.600 --> 06:16.800
Yan, I guess this trip is not in vain.

94
06:17.040 --> 06:18.240
What did you pray for?

95
06:19.510 --> 06:20.600
I said a prayer...

96
06:22.560 --> 06:23.860
for Li Qingyang.

97
06:25.830 --> 06:27.190
Don't people say

98
06:27.920 --> 06:29.650
that bad guys always live long?

99
06:30.430 --> 06:32.040
With the way he usually is,

100
06:32.430 --> 06:34.290
he wouldn't easily die, would he?

101
06:35.390 --> 06:37.050
I just prayed for him to always

102
06:38.720 --> 06:40.520
turn misfortune into blessing.

103
06:45.390 --> 06:46.190
Let's go

104
06:46.360 --> 06:47.430
take a look in town.

105
06:47.600 --> 06:48.240
Sure.

106
06:58.500 --> 07:02.430
[Chenwai Inn]

107
07:25.830 --> 07:27.760
Why are you staring at me like that?

108
07:28.560 --> 07:30.120
How did you know they were

109
07:30.560 --> 07:32.620
setting out to see the Golden Dragon?

110
07:34.120 --> 07:35.320
That was a no brainer.

111
07:35.630 --> 07:36.650
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

112
07:36.650 --> 07:39.240
is the destination of the Grand Heir Apparent's trip.

113
07:39.240 --> 07:40.110
So they would surely

114
07:40.110 --> 07:41.640
scout out that place first.

115
07:45.190 --> 07:46.040
Careful.

116
07:47.830 --> 07:48.720
Jiuying,

117
07:49.190 --> 07:50.500
as the saying goes,

118
07:50.830 --> 07:53.630
experience beats youth, and patience beats haste.

119
07:53.630 --> 07:54.630
When drinking tea,

120
07:54.630 --> 07:56.159
you should do it the way I do.

121
08:05.310 --> 08:06.600
Have them over for tea.

122
08:07.560 --> 08:09.160
I told you about it, didn't I?

123
08:09.390 --> 08:10.430
This time, we are

124
08:10.560 --> 08:11.800
on a secret mission.

125
08:13.040 --> 08:14.440
What is a secret mission?

126
08:15.260 --> 08:17.280
A secret mission means...

127
08:19.040 --> 08:20.510
we must know

128
08:20.750 --> 08:22.190
what they know.

129
08:22.430 --> 08:24.290
However, they don't necessarily

130
08:24.630 --> 08:26.310
have to know what we know.

131
08:27.800 --> 08:29.190
But I think

132
08:29.510 --> 08:30.920
Mr. Yan got thirsty.

133
08:34.030 --> 08:35.390
I saw him

134
08:36.030 --> 08:37.120
drinking water.

135
08:39.390 --> 08:41.150
That was the holy water of the Dragon Pond.

136
08:41.150 --> 08:42.320
Mr. Yan must have

137
08:42.840 --> 08:44.120
drunk that for me.

138
08:45.960 --> 08:47.820
I guess he still has a conscience.

139
08:48.910 --> 08:50.630
What do we do next?

140
08:51.630 --> 08:52.550
Jiuying,

141
08:53.530 --> 08:54.790
before setting out for Gutan,

142
08:54.790 --> 08:57.320
what did the chief instruct you to do?

143
08:58.030 --> 09:00.890
To serve tea, fight for you, and do all your bidding.

144
09:03.000 --> 09:05.350
Let me serve tea to you then.

145
09:07.720 --> 09:08.510
And you...

146
09:09.030 --> 09:10.610
shall do my bidding.

147
09:20.000 --> 09:20.910
Make way!

148
09:21.320 --> 09:22.580
All of you, move aside!

149
09:24.440 --> 09:25.300
Clear the path!

150
09:26.840 --> 09:27.720
Make way for us!

151
09:29.570 --> 09:31.830
[Xuanjie]

152
09:30.440 --> 09:31.150
Move aside!

153
09:31.830 --> 09:35.160
[Sui Bing, Commanding General of Xuanjie Battalion]

154
09:35.560 --> 09:38.440
[Ji Xun, Lieutenant General of Xuanjie Battalion]

155
09:39.630 --> 09:40.440
Get out of the way!

156
09:40.440 --> 09:41.200
It's him.

157
09:41.200 --> 09:42.840
What's he so arrogant about?

158
09:42.810 --> 09:46.550
[Xuanjie]

159
09:43.240 --> 09:44.440
Xuanjie Battalion

160
09:44.440 --> 09:45.390
lost two cities in a row

161
09:45.390 --> 09:46.720
last year on the northern border.

162
09:46.720 --> 09:48.320
Fortunately, the Third Prince took command

163
09:48.320 --> 09:50.520
at that critical time and got them back.

164
09:51.240 --> 09:52.600
If I were this general,

165
09:53.000 --> 09:54.240
I would've gotten so ashamed

166
09:54.240 --> 09:55.770
that I'd pack up and go home.

167
09:57.120 --> 09:58.440
What was His Majesty thinking,

168
09:58.440 --> 09:59.910
sending a defeated general

169
09:59.910 --> 10:01.910
to protect the Grand Heir Apparant?

170
10:02.030 --> 10:04.030
Maybe it wasn't His Majesty's idea.

171
10:04.240 --> 10:05.390
I heard from my father

172
10:05.390 --> 10:07.360
that Sui Bing, the commanding general of Xuanjie Battalion,

173
10:07.360 --> 10:08.840
is an aide to the First Prince.

174
10:08.840 --> 10:10.360
By coming in person to pray, the Grand Heir Apparent

175
10:10.360 --> 10:12.600
has brought much glory to the Crown Prince.

176
10:12.600 --> 10:13.670
How could Prince Ding not seize

177
10:13.670 --> 10:16.000
this great opportunity to show filial piety?

178
10:16.000 --> 10:18.000
Prince Ding has been stripped of his title and confined,

179
10:18.000 --> 10:19.480
but he surely won't yield.

180
10:19.510 --> 10:22.570
I bet he facilitated this arrangement by secret means.

181
10:23.150 --> 10:24.260
Are you suggesting

182
10:24.790 --> 10:26.390
that His Majesty intends

183
10:26.390 --> 10:28.390
to help the First Prince rise again?

184
10:29.200 --> 10:30.530
It can be a possibility.

185
10:30.870 --> 10:31.550
Look,

186
10:31.550 --> 10:33.030
it's His Highness Prince Ping!

187
10:33.030 --> 10:34.750
Your Highness Prince Ping!

188
10:34.840 --> 10:37.440
Your Highness Prince Ping!

189
10:37.460 --> 10:39.960
Your Highness Prince Ping!

190
10:37.610 --> 10:40.890
[Zhou Zhu, Prince Ping, the Third Prince of Great Shi]

191
10:39.980 --> 10:43.490
Your Highness Prince Ping!

192
10:45.650 --> 10:47.170
Your Highness Prince Ping!

193
10:47.170 --> 10:48.560
Your Highness Prince Ping!

194
10:48.560 --> 10:50.030
Your Highness Prince Ping!

195
10:50.030 --> 10:51.760
Your Highness! Your Highness!

196
10:51.790 --> 10:52.990
Your Highness!

197
10:53.020 --> 10:54.230
It's been a long time,

198
10:56.000 --> 10:57.930
-Zhu. -Your Highness Prince Ping!

199
10:58.720 --> 11:00.250
Your Highness Prince Ping!

200
11:01.260 --> 11:03.390
His Highness Prince Ping has arrived.

201
11:04.230 --> 11:06.920
Your Highness Prince Ping!

202
11:08.750 --> 11:09.910
Your Highness Prince Ping!

203
11:09.420 --> 11:10.810
[Xuanjie]

204
11:17.410 --> 11:18.360
General Sui.

205
11:22.630 --> 11:23.960
Your Highness Prince Ping,

206
11:23.960 --> 11:25.150
fancy meeting you here.

207
11:25.150 --> 11:26.110
I thought you were

208
11:26.110 --> 11:27.510
waiting outside the city

209
11:28.210 --> 11:29.290
for His Highness

210
11:29.320 --> 11:32.320
the Grand Heir Apparent's arrival.

211
11:33.840 --> 11:35.340
The order I received

212
11:35.550 --> 11:36.750
is to station at Gutan

213
11:36.790 --> 11:38.150
and eliminate hidden dangers.

214
11:38.150 --> 11:39.750
Gutan County is vast.

215
11:39.770 --> 11:41.140
Just suit yourself.

216
11:41.550 --> 11:42.840
Station wherever

217
11:42.840 --> 11:43.790
you like.

218
11:44.510 --> 11:45.960
The order I received is to

219
11:46.510 --> 11:48.710
safeguard the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

220
11:48.750 --> 11:49.840
Now it seems

221
11:49.920 --> 11:50.920
you and I

222
11:51.030 --> 11:52.430
each have our own duties.

223
11:52.630 --> 11:54.690
What do you mean by that, General Sui?

224
11:56.150 --> 11:57.910
Just what it literally means.

225
12:00.150 --> 12:02.080
Isn't that Sui Bing, a subordinate

226
12:02.120 --> 12:04.440
of my eldest brother, who leapt three ranks overnight

227
12:04.440 --> 12:07.300
and was bestowed with the title of General Huaihua?

228
12:07.910 --> 12:09.600
He's merely a defeated general.

229
12:09.600 --> 12:10.620
What right does he

230
12:10.650 --> 12:12.210
have to challenge Zhu?

231
12:13.550 --> 12:15.800
If my memory serves me right,

232
12:16.120 --> 12:17.990
the Golden Dragon Pavilion

233
12:18.240 --> 12:19.640
is at the end of this road.

234
12:19.840 --> 12:20.630
General,

235
12:21.670 --> 12:22.480
you're right.

236
12:23.550 --> 12:24.410
Your Highness,

237
12:24.630 --> 12:26.440
I shall take my leave.

238
12:54.320 --> 12:55.120
Let's go.

239
13:15.350 --> 13:18.710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

240
13:19.150 --> 13:21.080
Tanghulu!

241
13:27.200 --> 13:28.360
What are you looking at?

242
13:28.360 --> 13:30.240
Tanghulu!

243
13:31.630 --> 13:33.150
From what we've seen along the way,

244
13:33.150 --> 13:34.780
the people in Gutan County

245
13:34.910 --> 13:36.670
dwell in peace and contentment.

246
13:36.670 --> 13:38.150
The area is bustling with activity.

247
13:38.150 --> 13:39.600
And this main street

248
13:39.600 --> 13:40.960
is absolutely buzzing.

249
13:40.960 --> 13:42.550
-Gui. Gui! -But look at this shop.

250
13:42.550 --> 13:43.200
Don't go in there.

251
13:43.200 --> 13:44.150
Someone died inside.

252
13:44.150 --> 13:45.290
Let's leave now!

253
13:48.390 --> 13:49.440
Zhenzhu, you see,

254
13:50.150 --> 13:52.120
the threshold of the shop is severely worn.

255
13:52.120 --> 13:53.030
This means

256
13:53.030 --> 13:54.630
there were usually many people coming and going.

257
13:53.350 --> 13:55.790
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

258
13:54.630 --> 13:56.000
The business must've been good.

259
13:56.000 --> 13:56.960
But why is it

260
13:56.990 --> 13:58.320
so quiet today?

261
13:58.630 --> 14:00.000
Plus what happened just now...

262
14:00.000 --> 14:01.200
Look at these passers-by.

263
14:01.040 --> 14:02.710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

264
14:01.510 --> 14:02.750
They look at this shop

265
14:02.750 --> 14:04.390
as if it were a den of plague.

266
14:04.600 --> 14:05.800
Don't you find it odd?

267
14:06.910 --> 14:08.320
Impressive, Yan.

268
14:08.840 --> 14:10.300
You really are something.

269
14:10.360 --> 14:11.030
Let's go

270
14:11.030 --> 14:11.750
and take a look.

271
14:11.750 --> 14:12.440
Sure.

272
14:15.840 --> 14:17.990
My Lords! My Lords!

273
14:19.200 --> 14:20.490
My Lords.

274
14:19.300 --> 14:21.710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

275
14:20.960 --> 14:23.960
I am Du Zhongtao, Magistrate of Gutan County.

276
14:23.960 --> 14:25.790
The two of you have an extraordinary bearing.

277
14:25.790 --> 14:28.600
May I ask if you are from Tianhuang City?

278
14:30.840 --> 14:32.320
Within half a day of our arrival,

279
14:32.320 --> 14:34.180
someone's already calling on us.

280
14:34.630 --> 14:36.000
We are both head constables

281
14:36.000 --> 14:38.030
of the Divine Constable Bureau in Tianhuang City.

282
14:38.030 --> 14:39.320
This is Constable Frost.

283
14:39.320 --> 14:41.180
We are here on official business.

284
14:41.600 --> 14:43.530
As it turns out, you are two

285
14:43.560 --> 14:44.870
of the renowned Divine Constables.

286
14:44.870 --> 14:45.720
To think that two

287
14:45.720 --> 14:48.390
out of the four Divine Constables are present in person,

288
14:48.390 --> 14:49.720
I am utterly terrified.

289
14:49.840 --> 14:51.790
We are just here on official business.

290
14:51.790 --> 14:53.650
What are you terrified of, Mr. Du?

291
14:55.000 --> 14:57.600
The royals have repeatedly granted grace

292
14:57.600 --> 14:59.340
on our tiny Gutan County.

293
14:59.440 --> 15:02.320
Soon, the Grand Heir Apparent will arrive.

294
15:02.510 --> 15:03.390
And now we have received

295
15:03.390 --> 15:05.320
the two lords of you from the Imperial City.

296
15:05.320 --> 15:07.120
How can I, as the magistrate here,

297
15:07.120 --> 15:08.600
not be terrified?

298
15:11.200 --> 15:12.200
My Lords,

299
15:12.360 --> 15:13.960
are you hungry?

300
15:14.030 --> 15:16.200
Why not follow me to the county office?

301
15:16.200 --> 15:17.960
I will prepare some wine

302
15:18.000 --> 15:19.600
as a gesture of hospitality.

303
15:21.120 --> 15:22.000
This bun shop seems fine.

304
15:22.000 --> 15:23.000
So, don't bother.

305
15:23.360 --> 15:24.310
My Lords!

306
15:24.630 --> 15:25.690
What's this about?

307
15:47.320 --> 15:49.550
You filthy scoundrels!

308
15:49.960 --> 15:51.310
You're vile and rotten to the core!

309
15:51.310 --> 15:52.720
None of you are any good!

310
15:54.510 --> 15:55.780
Take off

311
15:55.910 --> 15:57.770
the human skin you're wearing

312
15:58.000 --> 15:59.080
already

313
15:59.240 --> 16:00.640
and show your true forms!

314
16:06.600 --> 16:07.390
Listen!

315
16:07.960 --> 16:09.910
The shadow puppet ghost is here.

316
16:10.630 --> 16:12.940
Maybe you should all be killed,

317
16:13.200 --> 16:15.510
have your hearts and livers cut out,

318
16:15.790 --> 16:17.580
and return to the origin!

319
16:17.750 --> 16:18.810
You crazy cripple,

320
16:18.830 --> 16:20.240
what's that nonsense about?

321
16:20.240 --> 16:21.090
Zhao Quan!

322
16:21.270 --> 16:21.960
Yes!

323
16:21.960 --> 16:22.630
Shut up!

324
16:22.630 --> 16:23.360
Go after him!

325
16:23.360 --> 16:24.280
Catch him!

326
16:27.000 --> 16:28.020
Catch him!

327
16:32.430 --> 16:33.630
How dare you bite me!

328
16:33.630 --> 16:34.750
Go after him!

329
16:34.750 --> 16:35.510
Stop!

330
16:36.600 --> 16:37.600
What's there to see?

331
16:37.600 --> 16:38.200
Move aside!

332
16:38.200 --> 16:39.030
Mr. Du,

333
16:39.630 --> 16:41.830
What's that shadow puppet ghost about?

334
16:42.000 --> 16:42.840
Just...

335
16:43.550 --> 16:46.000
some rumors among the people.

336
16:46.150 --> 16:47.280
Not credible at all.

337
16:49.120 --> 16:50.250
But there's no smoke

338
16:50.440 --> 16:51.630
without fire.

339
16:52.910 --> 16:54.000
Mr. Du, right?

340
16:54.960 --> 16:55.750
Let's go.

341
16:56.360 --> 16:57.960
Bring us to the county office

342
16:58.840 --> 17:00.700
and explain this matter clearly.

343
17:07.440 --> 17:08.240
Jiuying,

344
17:08.589 --> 17:09.589
is this the place?

345
17:10.240 --> 17:12.200
I saw Zhenzhu and Mr. Yan attempt

346
17:12.150 --> 17:13.500
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

347
17:12.200 --> 17:13.260
to enter this shop.

348
17:13.720 --> 17:14.579
Let's go inside

349
17:14.750 --> 17:15.800
for a look.

350
17:23.349 --> 17:24.160
Sir,

351
17:24.160 --> 17:25.440
take a seat, please.

352
17:25.550 --> 17:26.349
Sir,

353
17:27.000 --> 17:27.780
why aren't there

354
17:27.780 --> 17:29.600
any customers in your shop?

355
17:30.400 --> 17:31.200
There are.

356
17:31.200 --> 17:32.560
Who says there's no customer?

357
17:32.560 --> 17:33.830
A group of them just left.

358
17:33.830 --> 17:34.640
It's just a coincidence

359
17:34.640 --> 17:36.200
that there are no one else here now.

360
17:36.200 --> 17:36.920
This is perfect

361
17:36.920 --> 17:38.980
for you to enjoy peace and quietness.

362
17:41.000 --> 17:42.460
But everything seems cold

363
17:42.830 --> 17:44.030
in your shop.

364
17:44.160 --> 17:46.240
There isn't even a hint of cooking fire.

365
17:46.240 --> 17:48.170
Obviously, nobody has dined here.

366
17:48.920 --> 17:49.860
Could this shop

367
17:50.590 --> 17:52.590
of yours be a crooked establishment

368
17:52.830 --> 17:54.360
that no one dares to come to?

369
17:56.830 --> 17:58.110
Hey, mister,

370
17:58.750 --> 18:00.030
are you here to eat

371
18:00.030 --> 18:01.270
or to trash the place?

372
18:01.310 --> 18:02.200
I'd rather not

373
18:02.310 --> 18:03.510
do business with you.

374
18:03.550 --> 18:04.350
Please leave.

375
18:04.550 --> 18:05.350
Sir,

376
18:06.530 --> 18:07.590
I was just kidding.

377
18:07.640 --> 18:08.770
Please don't be mad.

378
18:09.350 --> 18:10.160
Jiuying,

379
18:10.160 --> 18:10.880
sit down.

380
18:13.720 --> 18:15.510
Whatever kinds of buns you have in here,

381
18:15.510 --> 18:16.800
serve them all.

382
18:17.750 --> 18:18.640
Yin Xiaoshan.

383
18:20.730 --> 18:21.570
Yin Xiaoshan!

384
18:22.440 --> 18:23.440
Yin Xiaoshan!

385
18:27.190 --> 18:29.220
You lazy bones,

386
18:29.350 --> 18:30.590
Am I paying you

387
18:30.620 --> 18:32.030
to enjoy yourself here?

388
18:32.200 --> 18:33.440
Get up right now!

389
18:36.400 --> 18:37.830
Serve buns to the guests!

390
18:38.030 --> 18:39.200
Boss,

391
18:39.310 --> 18:40.830
all your employees ran away.

392
18:40.830 --> 18:41.660
I came to help

393
18:41.690 --> 18:42.830
only out of pity.

394
18:43.310 --> 18:44.240
Speak nonsense again,

395
18:44.240 --> 18:45.770
and I'll deduct your wages!

396
18:50.550 --> 18:52.810
You think I care about that little money?

397
18:52.830 --> 18:53.580
It is known to all

398
18:53.580 --> 18:55.110
that I, Master Xiaoshan of the Golden Dragon Pavilion, am

399
18:55.110 --> 18:58.570
brave and wise, even with the capability of holding up the sky.

400
18:59.830 --> 19:00.590
Jiuying.

401
19:01.000 --> 19:02.200
we're in luck.

402
19:04.830 --> 19:05.640
Dig in.

403
19:06.240 --> 19:07.240
Master Xiaoshan.

404
19:08.400 --> 19:09.510
To be honest,

405
19:09.920 --> 19:11.780
Working in a small shop like this,

406
19:11.960 --> 19:13.000
even if you put up with

407
19:13.000 --> 19:14.260
all that humiliation,

408
19:14.720 --> 19:16.350
you still won't earn much.

409
19:16.590 --> 19:18.110
Judging from what you just said,

410
19:18.110 --> 19:20.440
it seems you have a post in the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

411
19:20.440 --> 19:23.110
I wonder if you, Master Xiaoshan, have

412
19:23.350 --> 19:25.160
any connections in the pavilion.

413
19:25.160 --> 19:26.350
Who are you?

414
19:26.960 --> 19:28.110
Why ask about that?

415
19:30.000 --> 19:31.200
To tell you the truth,

416
19:31.480 --> 19:32.270
my name is

417
19:33.110 --> 19:34.230
Li Xiaosi,

418
19:34.440 --> 19:36.110
and I'm hoping to earn a position

419
19:36.110 --> 19:37.750
in the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

420
19:37.750 --> 19:40.510
I long for your instructions, Master Xiaoshan.

421
19:39.310 --> 19:42.370
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

422
19:41.720 --> 19:43.030
This is just a small gift

423
19:43.030 --> 19:44.310
to show my sincerity.

424
19:44.550 --> 19:45.750
Once it's done,

425
19:46.000 --> 19:47.320
I'll reward you handsomely.

426
19:47.320 --> 19:48.910
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

427
19:50.110 --> 19:50.920
That's easy.

428
19:50.920 --> 19:51.920
No sweat at all.

429
19:53.350 --> 19:54.350
Listen,

430
19:54.510 --> 19:56.960
there is a department of food affairs in the pavilion.

431
19:56.960 --> 19:58.160
It's the most

432
19:58.200 --> 19:59.790
crucial place in there.

433
20:00.030 --> 20:02.630
Many people are dying to get in but still can't.

434
20:02.720 --> 20:03.690
Does it mean

435
20:04.000 --> 20:05.260
you have a way in for me?

436
20:05.350 --> 20:08.030
As long as you're not stingy with treasure notes,

437
20:08.030 --> 20:10.000
Mr. Li, just leave the task to me.

438
20:15.400 --> 20:16.200
Enjoy!

439
20:18.590 --> 20:19.440
Jiuying.

440
20:20.590 --> 20:21.720
Go to the county office now

441
20:21.720 --> 20:22.980
to do something for me.

442
20:23.950 --> 20:27.190
[Gutan County Government]

443
20:24.790 --> 20:25.590
What?

444
20:25.720 --> 20:27.240
Nine people were killed?

445
20:27.590 --> 20:28.400
Du Zhongtao!

446
20:29.000 --> 20:30.330
What kind of magistrate

447
20:30.340 --> 20:31.030
are you?

448
20:31.160 --> 20:32.270
You are concealing facts of crimes.

449
20:32.270 --> 20:34.130
Don't you know the consequences?

450
20:37.160 --> 20:38.460
Why didn't you report

451
20:38.590 --> 20:39.990
such a magnificent case?

452
20:40.110 --> 20:42.070
The Grand Heir Apparent will arrive soon.

453
20:42.070 --> 20:43.530
How dare I report the case?

454
20:43.640 --> 20:45.400
If it delays the blessing ceremony

455
20:45.400 --> 20:46.790
and affects His Majesty's health,

456
20:46.790 --> 20:47.830
I can't bear the blame

457
20:47.830 --> 20:49.290
of such a monstrous crime.

458
20:51.000 --> 20:52.440
Is there any progress on the investigation?

459
20:52.440 --> 20:53.400
No, none at all.

460
20:54.070 --> 20:54.830
Fine then.

461
20:54.830 --> 20:55.640
Du Zhongtao,

462
20:55.720 --> 20:56.980
be seated. Don't move.

463
20:58.310 --> 20:59.070
You useless official,

464
20:59.070 --> 21:00.110
-I'll kill you! You believe that? -Yan, Yan!

465
21:00.110 --> 21:00.550
Yan!

466
21:00.550 --> 21:01.160
It's not like that.

467
21:01.160 --> 21:02.960
I wish I could do something.

468
21:02.960 --> 21:03.830
But the case

469
21:03.830 --> 21:05.240
was not done by humans,

470
21:05.310 --> 21:07.510
so it certainly can't be solved by human power.

471
21:07.510 --> 21:08.710
What did you just say?

472
21:09.310 --> 21:10.480
As an official of the imperial court,

473
21:10.480 --> 21:11.590
you actually believe such nonsense

474
21:11.590 --> 21:13.400
instead of conducting a thorough investigation!

475
21:13.400 --> 21:14.110
I think you just

476
21:14.110 --> 21:15.830
made all that gibberish up to shirk your responsibility

477
21:15.830 --> 21:16.830
for dereliction of duty!

478
21:16.830 --> 21:17.790
Feel free to ask

479
21:17.790 --> 21:19.100
any locals you want, My Lords.

480
21:19.100 --> 21:19.830
Then you will know

481
21:19.830 --> 21:21.000
if I made up anything!

482
21:21.000 --> 21:22.400
As for the responsibility for dereliction of duty...

483
21:22.400 --> 21:24.030
I've long heard about the perception and shrewdness

484
21:24.030 --> 21:25.030
of the Divine Constables in solving cases.

485
21:25.030 --> 21:25.890
Today, with you two

486
21:25.890 --> 21:27.030
Divine Constables here,

487
21:27.030 --> 21:28.440
won't the case be solved soon?

488
21:28.440 --> 21:30.510
And how can I be accused of dereliction of duty?

489
21:30.510 --> 21:32.150
I really can't stand this. I...

490
21:32.150 --> 21:33.080
Where's my whip?

491
21:33.110 --> 21:34.590
I'll whip or hack you to death!

492
21:34.590 --> 21:36.110
-My Lord! My Lord! -Stop right there!

493
21:36.110 --> 21:36.830
You terrible official!

494
21:36.830 --> 21:38.030
Master! Master!

495
21:38.200 --> 21:39.000
Divine Constables!

496
21:39.000 --> 21:40.240
I've brought Yin Baiquan here.

497
21:40.240 --> 21:40.550
Quick.

498
21:40.550 --> 21:41.010
Master.

499
21:41.030 --> 21:42.240
This is Yin Baiquan, a body recovery worker.

500
21:42.240 --> 21:44.440
My Lords, ask him if you have any doubts.

501
21:44.720 --> 21:47.240
I'm Yin Baiquan, a body recovery worker. Greetings, My Lords.

502
21:47.240 --> 21:48.220
Rise and speak.

503
21:50.240 --> 21:51.970
You are a body recovery worker?

504
21:52.110 --> 21:53.440
On the 28th of last month,

505
21:53.440 --> 21:54.720
some were murdered on Mount Hanhao.

506
21:54.720 --> 21:56.350
And five died on the 6th of this month.

507
21:56.350 --> 21:57.750
Did you collect all their bodies?

508
21:57.750 --> 21:58.750
Yes, I did.

509
21:58.750 --> 22:00.200
How many bodies in total?

510
22:00.310 --> 22:02.510
Including the four from Mount Hanhao,

511
22:02.510 --> 22:03.750
there are nine bodies in total.

512
22:03.750 --> 22:05.330
Nine bodies.

513
22:05.750 --> 22:07.050
Where are they now?

514
22:08.500 --> 22:10.070
Lady Constable Frost is asking you.

515
22:10.070 --> 22:11.550
Why are you looking at me?

516
22:12.550 --> 22:14.510
Since they were all from Yin Village,

517
22:14.510 --> 22:15.200
I chose to

518
22:15.220 --> 22:15.830
bury them

519
22:15.830 --> 22:17.100
in the village graveyard.

520
22:17.100 --> 22:19.760
This way, they were brought back to their roots.

521
22:20.270 --> 22:21.130
Got it.

522
22:21.160 --> 22:23.690
I'll dig up the graves and examine the bodies.

523
22:28.350 --> 22:28.960
My Lady,

524
22:28.960 --> 22:30.510
I'm afraid this is inappropriate.

525
22:30.510 --> 22:31.240
Zhao Quan!

526
22:31.640 --> 22:33.010
Lady Constable Frost plans to examine the bodies,

527
22:33.010 --> 22:34.200
yet you're trying to stop her.

528
22:34.200 --> 22:35.000
Why?

529
22:35.110 --> 22:36.920
Do you mean to obstruct the bureau's investigation of the case?

530
22:36.920 --> 22:37.880
I wouldn't dare.

531
22:37.920 --> 22:39.310
I wouldn't dare to do so.

532
22:39.550 --> 22:40.720
It's just that the graveyard

533
22:40.720 --> 22:41.810
is where the ancestors of Yin Village

534
22:41.810 --> 22:42.550
are buried.

535
22:42.550 --> 22:43.550
My concern

536
22:43.550 --> 22:44.470
is that the villagers

537
22:44.470 --> 22:46.020
will definitely think the feng shui and luck

538
22:46.020 --> 22:47.550
are ruined if we dig up the graves.

539
22:47.550 --> 22:48.440
In a worst case scenario,

540
22:48.440 --> 22:49.650
they might try to fight us to death.

541
22:49.650 --> 22:50.440
If that happens,

542
22:50.440 --> 22:52.570
things will go completely out of hand.

543
22:52.920 --> 22:54.440
Public anger and resentment

544
22:54.440 --> 22:56.480
are like fierce floods and savage beasts.

545
22:56.480 --> 22:57.590
Don't you think the dignified

546
22:57.590 --> 22:58.510
Divine Constables know that?

547
22:58.510 --> 22:59.970
Cut it out, smarty-pants!

548
23:03.750 --> 23:04.920
Lady Constable Frost,

549
23:04.920 --> 23:06.180
what's your decision?

550
23:07.640 --> 23:09.880
Mr. Du, you manage the whole county.

551
23:09.920 --> 23:11.980
It is your duty to care for the people.

552
23:12.160 --> 23:13.200
What Zhao Quan just said

553
23:13.200 --> 23:14.310
does make sense.

554
23:14.920 --> 23:15.960
Given all that,

555
23:16.160 --> 23:18.550
I've decided not to examine the bodies.

556
23:24.270 --> 23:25.750
Who's there? Halt!

557
23:28.020 --> 23:28.830
Stop!

558
23:33.810 --> 23:38.500
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

559
23:46.270 --> 23:47.070
Proceed.

560
23:49.270 --> 23:50.070
Keep moving.

561
23:52.000 --> 23:52.850
Off you go.

562
23:54.250 --> 23:55.220
Stop!

563
23:56.270 --> 23:57.580
Are you new to...

564
23:58.550 --> 23:59.530
Director Liu.

565
24:02.110 --> 24:03.940
Are the vegetables fresh today?

566
24:04.070 --> 24:04.920
Yes.

567
24:04.920 --> 24:06.580
Freshly picked this morning.

568
24:08.350 --> 24:09.160
Good.

569
24:09.240 --> 24:10.250
Go in then.

570
24:11.880 --> 24:14.140
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

571
24:13.680 --> 24:14.510
Smarten up.

572
24:14.510 --> 24:15.570
Don't look around.

573
24:16.350 --> 24:17.630
One gold ingot

574
24:17.720 --> 24:19.350
for the deputy director's badge.

575
24:19.350 --> 24:20.610
It's a real bargain.

576
24:20.680 --> 24:21.750
Thanks, Xiaoshan.

577
24:22.160 --> 24:23.420
Stop right there!

578
24:25.310 --> 24:26.270
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

579
24:25.510 --> 24:26.310
Stop!

580
24:27.310 --> 24:27.960
You stop there!

581
24:27.960 --> 24:29.020
Don't you run away!

582
24:29.510 --> 24:30.960
What are you looking at?

583
24:30.960 --> 24:31.310
Jiuying?

584
24:31.310 --> 24:31.960
Go inside and work!

585
24:31.960 --> 24:32.680
Why is it you?

586
24:32.680 --> 24:33.110
Get a move on!

587
24:33.110 --> 24:33.830
Let's go.

588
24:33.880 --> 24:35.110
I go wherever you go.

589
24:35.110 --> 24:35.880
Ridiculous!

590
24:36.070 --> 24:36.960
Who sent you here?

591
24:36.960 --> 24:37.920
Go back to where you set out from.

592
24:37.920 --> 24:38.640
I won't!

593
24:38.830 --> 24:39.750
Oh, kiddo...

594
24:39.770 --> 24:40.790
There are rules and regulations

595
24:40.790 --> 24:42.310
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

596
24:42.310 --> 24:43.220
Come here!

597
24:43.960 --> 24:44.750
Stop.

598
24:46.310 --> 24:47.310
By order of the general,

599
24:47.310 --> 24:48.510
nobody are allowed in except those

600
24:48.510 --> 24:50.160
working for the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

601
24:50.160 --> 24:51.750
His Highness Prince Ping would like to station

602
24:51.750 --> 24:52.750
at the pavilion with a small troop.

603
24:52.750 --> 24:54.480
Please inform General Sui.

604
24:54.480 --> 24:55.680
I said no entry.

605
24:55.720 --> 24:57.030
And that means no entry.

606
24:57.030 --> 24:58.480
Informing the general won't help.

607
24:58.480 --> 24:58.960
Leave now!

608
24:58.960 --> 25:00.760
Who are you to deny them of entry?

609
25:01.510 --> 25:02.310
You stay put.

610
25:02.640 --> 25:03.570
Watch and learn.

611
25:04.750 --> 25:07.030
We all bear the duty of protecting the royals.

612
25:07.030 --> 25:07.960
Better show some respect

613
25:07.960 --> 25:09.240
when it's needed.

614
25:11.680 --> 25:13.270
Open your eyes wide

615
25:12.110 --> 25:18.420
[Iron Constable]

616
25:13.270 --> 25:14.680
and look carefully.

617
25:14.750 --> 25:16.810
I am from the Divine Constable Bureau

618
25:16.960 --> 25:18.560
directly under His Majesty.

619
25:19.750 --> 25:21.880
Let's see which of you dares to stop me.

620
25:22.550 --> 25:23.620
Back off!

621
25:26.310 --> 25:28.110
Showing no respect, aren't you?

622
25:32.470 --> 25:33.800
Who else cares for a try?

623
25:33.880 --> 25:34.690
Lord Constable Iron,

624
25:34.690 --> 25:36.440
instead of performing your duties in Tianhuang City,

625
25:35.770 --> 25:38.240
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

626
25:36.750 --> 25:38.550
what are you doing here at the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

627
25:38.550 --> 25:40.550
The Divine Constable Bureau is obligated

628
25:40.550 --> 25:42.960
to safeguard the Grand Heir Apparent.

629
25:43.030 --> 25:43.750
Xuanjie Battalion

630
25:43.750 --> 25:45.920
alone is enough to protect the Grand Heir Apparent.

631
25:45.920 --> 25:46.920
Lord Constable Iron,

632
25:46.920 --> 25:47.750
please leave.

633
25:47.960 --> 25:49.440
Xuanjie Battalion

634
25:49.920 --> 25:53.350
is renowned as one of the four major cavalries of Great Shi.

635
25:53.960 --> 25:55.360
But from what I see today,

636
25:56.550 --> 25:58.160
it's not that impressive.

637
25:58.750 --> 25:59.750
How is it supposed

638
25:59.750 --> 26:01.390
to shoulder the responsibility of protecting

639
26:01.390 --> 26:03.520
the Grand Heir Apparent in the future?

640
26:03.920 --> 26:06.110
General Sui, have you forgotten

641
26:06.160 --> 26:07.490
the cities that Xuanjie Battalion lost

642
26:07.490 --> 26:08.560
years ago

643
26:08.750 --> 26:10.360
were actually recovered

644
26:10.480 --> 26:12.160
by Yulin Army?

645
26:12.920 --> 26:13.780
One should

646
26:13.920 --> 26:15.550
repay kindness with gratitude.

647
26:15.550 --> 26:16.310
How insolent!

648
26:16.310 --> 26:17.420
Did I say anything wrong?

649
26:17.420 --> 26:19.280
Please don't be mad, General Sui.

650
26:19.720 --> 26:21.440
I'm Constable Frost Bai Zhenzhu from the Divine Constable Bureau.

651
26:21.440 --> 26:23.100
Greetings, General Sui Bing.

652
26:23.110 --> 26:24.180
You came

653
26:24.210 --> 26:25.740
in a crowd, didn't you?

654
26:26.510 --> 26:27.930
We all just want to do our part

655
26:27.930 --> 26:29.260
for the imperial court.

656
26:29.270 --> 26:31.350
Just now, Constable Iron got a bit anxious.

657
26:31.350 --> 26:33.210
Please forgive him, General Sui.

658
26:33.720 --> 26:35.220
What a misunderstanding.

659
26:35.240 --> 26:36.970
It turns out we're all friends.

660
26:37.110 --> 26:38.170
Du Zhongtao?

661
26:38.720 --> 26:40.480
Mr. Du and General Sui

662
26:40.520 --> 26:41.820
are acquaintances?

663
26:43.160 --> 26:45.620
The general and I are from the same hometown.

664
26:47.310 --> 26:48.070
Sui Bing,

665
26:48.070 --> 26:48.680
come on.

666
26:48.680 --> 26:50.270
My old friend, we're finally reunited.

667
26:50.270 --> 26:51.360
Let's go into the pavilion

668
26:51.360 --> 26:52.870
and do some catching up.

669
26:54.830 --> 26:56.030
Without my order,

670
26:56.070 --> 26:56.900
no one is allowed

671
26:56.900 --> 26:58.510
