1001
39:22.360 --> 39:23.820
Let's pool them together.

1002
39:24.710 --> 39:25.970
Lady Constable Frost.

1003
39:27.150 --> 39:28.450
In the first murder case,

1004
39:28.450 --> 39:29.550
the four victims

1005
39:29.550 --> 39:30.710
were two couples

1006
39:30.960 --> 39:31.960
in their thirties.

1007
39:31.960 --> 39:34.820
They were all herb gatherers living in Yin Village.

1008
39:34.840 --> 39:36.350
Given that their bodies were found

1009
39:36.350 --> 39:37.960
on Mount Hanhao at the same time,

1010
39:37.960 --> 39:39.110
hung like shadow puppets

1011
39:39.110 --> 39:40.360
on the same tree

1012
39:40.360 --> 39:41.920
with herb baskets on their backs,

1013
39:41.920 --> 39:43.550
it can be inferred that they probably

1014
39:43.550 --> 39:45.440
went to the mountain as a team to gather herbs

1015
39:45.440 --> 39:46.960
on the 28th of last month.

1016
39:47.070 --> 39:49.710
Then, they were killed by the shadow puppet ghost.

1017
39:49.710 --> 39:51.710
The household registration records show

1018
39:51.710 --> 39:53.030
that these two families lived close.

1019
39:53.030 --> 39:54.550
They should be acquaintances.

1020
39:54.550 --> 39:55.550
So, I am thinking

1021
39:55.550 --> 39:57.360
that the murderer could be

1022
39:57.360 --> 39:58.960
someone they both knew

1023
39:58.960 --> 40:01.070
or a villager from Yin Village.

1024
40:01.320 --> 40:02.720
As for the second murder,

1025
40:02.960 --> 40:04.670
it happened on the 6th of this month.

1026
40:04.670 --> 40:05.760
There were five

1027
40:06.550 --> 40:07.350
male victims,

1028
40:07.550 --> 40:09.810
aged between 20 and 45.

1029
40:10.030 --> 40:13.070
They were Yin Changrong, a butcher from Yin Village,

1030
40:13.280 --> 40:15.610
Kong Jiqing, a fur merchant from Yuezhou,

1031
40:15.680 --> 40:17.480
Duan Jiang, a carpenter from Lin County,

1032
40:17.480 --> 40:19.480
Kan Ning, a traveler from Caozhou,

1033
40:19.840 --> 40:20.840
and Jia Sheng,

1034
40:20.860 --> 40:23.110
a staffer at Changlai Steamed Bun Shop.

1035
40:23.320 --> 40:24.580
Among the five of them,

1036
40:24.630 --> 40:26.030
Yin Changrong and Jia Sheng

1037
40:26.030 --> 40:27.360
were from Gutan County.

1038
40:27.960 --> 40:29.360
The remaining three

1039
40:29.550 --> 40:30.950
were all from out of town.

1040
40:31.070 --> 40:32.470
Based on what we have now,

1041
40:32.550 --> 40:34.550
these people had nothing to do with each other.

1042
40:34.550 --> 40:36.350
And they didn't know each other.

1043
40:36.360 --> 40:38.180
Did the murderer choose

1044
40:39.150 --> 40:40.670
his targets at random?

1045
40:42.960 --> 40:44.620
Changlai Steamed Bun Shop...

1046
40:45.830 --> 40:48.210
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop, Food Market, West Fair of Gutan County]

1047
40:46.510 --> 40:48.030
I was wondering why the name

1048
40:48.030 --> 40:49.840
sounds so familiar.

1049
40:48.270 --> 40:50.690
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

1050
40:50.230 --> 40:51.280
This bun shop...

1051
40:51.480 --> 40:52.280
-Gui! -Lady Bai and I

1052
40:52.280 --> 40:53.710
-almost got in there. -Don't go in there.

1053
40:53.710 --> 40:55.920
No wonder it looks so strange

1054
40:56.550 --> 40:58.010
that no one dares to get in.

1055
40:58.030 --> 40:59.450
Now that I think about it,

1056
40:59.710 --> 41:00.960
people probably know

1057
41:01.280 --> 41:03.630
a staffer there was killed by a vengeful ghost.

1058
41:03.630 --> 41:04.890
Nobody would want to be

1059
41:05.280 --> 41:07.610
associated with that kind of misfortune.

1060
41:08.510 --> 41:09.840
I also found something.

1061
41:11.710 --> 41:13.150
According to the county annals,

1062
41:13.150 --> 41:14.960
the shadow puppetry art of Gutan County

1063
41:14.940 --> 41:16.090
[Zhang Deshan, aged 45, a citizen and a farmer]

1064
41:15.070 --> 41:16.960
can be traced back to more than 200 years ago.

1065
41:16.120 --> 41:17.930
[His wife, surnamed Wang, aged 42] [His daughter, Zhang Er'niang, aged12]

1066
41:17.110 --> 41:19.000
The lifelike puppets

1067
41:18.030 --> 41:18.280
[Chen Wenyuan, aged 32, a citizen, an organizer]

1068
41:19.000 --> 41:20.200
and excellent skills

1069
41:20.320 --> 41:23.320
won the art a reputation of "Fairy Dream."

1070
41:23.230 --> 41:29.270
[Commanding Yet Not Haughty]

1071
41:23.550 --> 41:25.630
Nowadays, many families in Gutan County

1072
41:25.630 --> 41:27.710
have made a living by producing shadow puppets

1073
41:27.710 --> 41:29.880
and performing shadow plays for generations.

1074
41:29.880 --> 41:32.150
There is a remark in the records, "when the Fairy Dream's on,"

1075
41:32.150 --> 41:35.350
"all streets are empty for people have flocked to see it."

1076
41:35.360 --> 41:36.360
No wonder

1077
41:36.550 --> 41:38.470
even a murder case in this place

1078
41:38.500 --> 41:39.690
seems so bizarre.

1079
41:40.150 --> 41:41.030
I found

1080
41:41.150 --> 41:42.880
something highly suspicious.

1081
41:43.230 --> 41:44.550
Among the nine victims,

1082
41:44.550 --> 41:46.480
there were young and middle-aged people,

1083
41:46.480 --> 41:48.150
all in their prime.

1084
41:48.440 --> 41:50.070
Seven of them were male,

1085
41:50.070 --> 41:51.800
who wouldn't be easily killed.

1086
41:51.840 --> 41:52.710
How exactly

1087
41:52.740 --> 41:53.880
did the murderer

1088
41:54.110 --> 41:55.280
manage to take so many lives

1089
41:55.280 --> 41:56.320
at the same time?

1090
41:56.550 --> 41:57.960
And he chose to dispose of

1091
41:57.960 --> 41:59.320
the bodies in a time-consuming

1092
41:59.320 --> 42:00.550
and laborious way.

1093
42:01.630 --> 42:03.670
He who is able to do both...

1094
42:04.320 --> 42:05.960
If it were not a ghost...

1095
42:06.880 --> 42:07.630
That means

1096
42:07.650 --> 42:09.440
the murderer had helpers.

1097
42:11.150 --> 42:13.070
Let's say the killings were done by a group.

1098
42:13.070 --> 42:16.030
Why would they kill these many people

1099
42:16.480 --> 42:17.150
and then

1100
42:17.150 --> 42:18.840
go to such great lengths

1101
42:18.840 --> 42:20.150
to hang the bodies up?

1102
42:20.440 --> 42:22.640
Could these killers have all gone crazy

1103
42:23.230 --> 42:25.320
for watching too many puppet plays so they decided

1104
42:25.320 --> 42:26.520
to imitate the plots?

1105
42:30.660 --> 42:32.130
[Law Enforced Impartially]

1106
42:31.070 --> 42:32.510
This might explain it.

1107
42:33.230 --> 42:34.960
Here is a file from six years ago

1108
42:35.070 --> 42:36.400
about the shadow puppet ghost

1109
42:36.400 --> 42:37.280
dreaded by the people.

1110
42:36.540 --> 42:37.850
[Murder committed by Yin Jie, shadow puppet artist]

1111
42:37.280 --> 42:38.150
He was named Yin Jie.

1112
42:37.850 --> 42:39.170
[from Yin Village, Gutan County]

1113
42:38.150 --> 42:40.080
Please take a look, Your Highness.

1114
42:40.550 --> 42:41.440
Now, it seems

1115
42:41.670 --> 42:42.590
the killer is imitating

1116
42:42.590 --> 42:44.030
the murder methods from back then,

1117
42:44.030 --> 42:45.460
and trying to pin the blame

1118
42:45.460 --> 42:46.900
on Yin Jie.

1119
42:47.320 --> 42:48.350
This way, those who don't know the truth

1120
42:48.350 --> 42:50.070
will associate it with the shadow puppet murders

1121
42:50.070 --> 42:52.230
and are deterred from investigating this case.

1122
42:52.230 --> 42:53.540
Yin Jie the murderer

1123
42:53.760 --> 42:55.420
fell to his death from the peak

1124
42:55.710 --> 42:57.170
of Mount Hanhao at the back

1125
42:57.480 --> 43:00.410
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion to avoid being caught.

1126
43:01.710 --> 43:03.240
Such is the way of the world.

1127
43:03.550 --> 43:04.880
Evil people do evil things.

1128
43:04.880 --> 43:05.710
But good people

1129
43:05.710 --> 43:07.370
shouldn't be bullied, right?

1130
43:08.320 --> 43:09.480
Maybe I shouldn't say this,

1131
43:09.480 --> 43:11.480
but Yin Jie was such a wretched soul.

1132
43:11.550 --> 43:13.400
His wife and children were killed.

1133
43:13.400 --> 43:14.230
A real man would

1134
43:14.230 --> 43:15.690
definitely take revenge.

1135
43:16.510 --> 43:17.920
Lord Yan, you abhor evil and are explicit

1136
43:17.920 --> 43:19.710
about what you like and dislike.

1137
43:19.710 --> 43:22.770
That's exactly what a Divine Constable should be like.

1138
43:23.150 --> 43:24.360
Now, the priority

1139
43:24.550 --> 43:26.290
[Law Enforced Impartially]

1140
43:24.630 --> 43:25.760
is to find out

1141
43:26.030 --> 43:28.030
the cause of death of these victims.

1142
43:35.550 --> 43:37.110
Rest assured, Your Highness.

1143
43:37.110 --> 43:39.570
Constable Iron and I have come up with a plan.

1144
43:53.070 --> 43:55.670
The Crown Prince sent the Grand Heir Apparent.

1145
44:00.150 --> 44:02.150
The First Prince assigned Sui Bing.

1146
44:05.480 --> 44:06.440
Plus

1147
44:07.230 --> 44:08.030
me

1148
44:09.670 --> 44:10.480
and

1149
44:12.480 --> 44:13.320
Zhu.

1150
44:16.550 --> 44:18.030
Now in Gutan County,

1151
44:19.110 --> 44:21.070
everyone's taking turns

1152
44:21.550 --> 44:22.760
to get on stage.
